    T092  CHK006's evaluator note was a third live site of the corrected
          benchmark population.
    T093  The benchmark-population narrowing lacked Principle VII's reversal
          trigger and production-scale alternative.
    T094  This marker claimed `.prettierignore` excludes the coverage directory.
          It does not; `.gitignore` does, which Prettier reads by default.
    T095  qc-report.md held no record of iteration 3.

  Iteration 5 (T096-T097) — 2 findings; both closed. The fourteen closures of
  iteration 4 were each re-checked across their whole class and all held.
    T096  manual-test.md started the serving boundary against the shared
          `procurement` database, which holds no forecast run — so the procedure
          returned 24 unranked lines in `no_active_run` against its own
          documented `total == 15`, and none of the PO-447x rows its scenarios
