  Iteration 7 (T100-T106) — 7 findings, six of them in artifacts about the work
    T100  T098's fix swept plan.md and left the same claim in tasks.md:52.
    T101  The marker's own section heading said "four iterations" above six.
    T102  The marker claimed *every* post-iteration-1 finding was an artifact
